  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Conceding and justifying a position",
     "texto": [
      "**Til tross for** introduces a concession («despite»); it can come before a noun (**til tross for kostnaden**) or before **at** plus a clause. **Tvert imot** marks contrast. In a professional discussion, present the criterion, acknowledge an objection and back up the conclusion with a verifiable example."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
